          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": null,
          "clip_start": 2.9,
          "clip_len": 4.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His name was Stanislav Petrov, the duty officer at a warning center. The screens showed one launch, then five.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 12,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261026_104434_b62c053e-fa10-49a3-869c-d8eb613ba842.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": null,
          "clip_start": 0.0,
          "clip_len": 4.4
        },
        {
          "words": 7,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261026_104434_b62c053e-fa10-49a3-869c-d8eb613ba842.mp4",
          "overlay": "1 LAUNCH, THEN 5",
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": {
            "url": "https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/eb5c6bc5-7980-4c5e-b08e-8e5c3ecb51de.mp3",
            "start": 5.0,
            "seconds": 2.5
          },
          "clip_start": 4.4,
          "clip_len": 2.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His orders: report an attack up the chain. That could have triggered a nuclear counterstrike. But something felt off.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 8,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261026_104435_7ae21887-1e06-4199-ba46-108a4e56088a.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": null,
          "clip_start": 0.0,
          "clip_len": 2.9
        },
        {
          "words": 11,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261026_104435_7ae21887-1e06-4199-ba46-108a4e56088a.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": null,
          "clip_start": 2.9,
          "clip_len": 4.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A real first strike would mean hundreds of missiles, not five. Ground radar saw nothing. He called it a false alarm.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 11,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261026_104435_f382a977-4be8-4453-ae86-cdefd6b6fea2.mp4",
          "overlay": "ONLY FIVE?",
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": null,
          "clip_start": 0.0,
          "clip_len": 4.2
        },
        {
          "words": 10,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261026_104435_f382a977-4be8-4453-ae86-cdefd6b6fea2.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "sfx": null,
          "clip_start": 4.2,
          "clip_len": 3.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He was right: the satellites had mistaken sunlight on high clouds for launches. Five missiles that were never there.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
